<title>JAPAN: Shintom shares rise on strong earnings.</title>
<headline>Shintom shares rise on strong earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Shintom Co Ltd rose in heavy trade on Monday morning, helped by its solid earnings report issued last week, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0110 GMT, the audio visual equipment maker's share price was up 20 yen at 528. Turnover was 1.536 million shares, making the issue the third most actively traded stock.  </p>
<p>On Thursday, Shintom forecast a parent current profit of 2.15 billion yen this business year to March 31, 1998, up from an actual 1.53 billion yen last year.</p>
